<title>USA: USDA gross cutout hide and offal value - Aug 8.</title>
<headline>USDA gross cutout hide and offal value - Aug 8.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hide and offal value from a</p>
<p>typical slaughter steer for today was estimated at $8.27 per cwt</p>
<p>live, down 0.01 when compared to Thursday's value. - USDA</p>
<p>FOB CENTRAL U.S. TODAY'S CALCULATIONS FOR BY-PRODUCT VALUE</p>
<p>(STEER) -			   Lbs   Price  Change   Value</p>
<p>Steer hide, butt brand	 4.91   76.50   -0.50    4.82</p>
<p>Tallow, edible		   1.20   20.25    -	 0.24</p>
<p>Tallow, packer bleachable    4.50   18.75    -	 0.84</p>
<p>Tongues, Swiss #1 Wht 0-3%   0.26  127.00    -	 0.33</p>
<p>Cheek meat, trmd		 0.32   75.75    -	 0.24</p>
<p>Head meat			  0.13   51.00    -	 0.07</p>
<p>Oxtail, selected		 0.16  157.00    -	 0.25</p>
<p>Hearts, reg, bone out	  0.38   30.00    -	 0.11</p>
<p>Lips, unscalded		  0.11   55.00    -	 0.06</p>
<p>Livers, slcted, gall off     0.96   35.00    2.00    0.34</p>
<p>Tripe, scalded edible	  0.65   32.00    -	 0.21</p>
<p>Tripe, honeycomb bleached    0.15   49.00    -	 0.07</p>
<p>Lungs, inedible		  0.47    5.20    -	 0.02</p>
<p>Melts				0.14    6.50    -	 0.01</p>
<p>Meat bone ml, 50% blk/ton    3.70  265.00    2.50    0.49</p>
<p>Blood meal, 85% blk/ton	0.60  565.00    -	 0.17</p>
<p>TOTAL :			   18.64			  8.27</p>
<p>The average value of hide and offal for the five days ending</p>
<p>Friday, August 8, 1997 was estimated at 8.30 per cwt., down -0.01 from last week and down -1.31 from last year. ((Chicago newsdesk 312 4087 8720))</p>
